Package: panelcointr
Title: Panel Cointegration Tests
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("G. Nono", "Ghislain", , "nonoghislain@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Authors of the dependency Rust crates", role = "cph",
           comment = "see file LICENSE.note")
  )
Description: Implements panel cointegration tests robust to cross-section
    dependence and structural breaks, including the error-correction tests
    of Westerlund (2007) <doi:10.1111/j.1468-0084.2007.00477.x>, the
    Durbin-Hausman tests of Westerlund (2008), and the tests of Banerjee and
    Carrion-i-Silvestre (2015, 2017). The computations are written in Rust.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
